# Icons Directory

Place your small icon PNG files here.

## Recommended Icons to Add:

### Navigation Icons
- `home.png` / `home_selected.png`
- `profile.png` / `profile_selected.png`
- `settings.png` / `settings_selected.png`

### Action Icons
- `add.png` - Add/Plus icon
- `edit.png` - Edit/Pencil icon
- `delete.png` - Delete/Trash icon
- `search.png` - Search/Magnifying glass
- `filter.png` - Filter options
- `sort.png` - Sort options

### Authentication Icons
- `google.png` - Google logo
- `facebook.png` - Facebook logo
- `apple.png` - Apple logo
- `email.png` - Email icon
- `lock.png` - Password/Lock icon
- `visibility.png` / `visibility_off.png` - Show/hide password

### Status Icons
- `success.png` - Success/Checkmark
- `error.png` - Error/X mark
- `warning.png` - Warning/Exclamation
- `info.png` - Information icon
- `notification.png` - Bell/Notification

### Media Icons
- `camera.png` - Camera icon
- `gallery.png` - Gallery/Photos
- `video.png` - Video camera
- `play.png` - Play button
- `pause.png` - Pause button

### Utility Icons
- `back.png` - Back arrow
- `forward.png` - Forward arrow
- `close.png` - Close/X button
- `menu.png` - Hamburger menu
- `more.png` - Three dots menu
- `share.png` - Share icon
- `download.png` - Download arrow
- `upload.png` - Upload arrow

## File Guidelines
- Size: 24x24px to 48x48px (actual size)
- Format: PNG with transparency
- Colors: Monochrome or brand colors
- Style: Consistent design language